  "summary": "Adds optional TaxMode/TaxRateBasisPoints/TaxRuleName to existing Orders and nonnull TaxableBasePiastres with default 0; creates DeliveryServices. No backfill derives tax bases for rows predating the migration. The tax-report endpoint loads orders and sums their frozen TaxableBase (ReportingQueryService.cs:103-110; SalesRules.cs:100-110), while initial Orders schema already stores TaxAmount and existing TaxRules. Thus any pre-migration taxed orders are included in reports with TaxableBase=0, leaving historical tax base unreconstructed. This is a concrete conditional historical-report integrity gap if prior taxed orders exist; migration chain has no data backfill, while live row population is unverified. Preserve as a conditional candidate; no canonical promotion.",
